sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Human
    participant UI as Headed UI
    participant Plane as App Control
    participant Model as AppModel
    participant Proof as Evidence dir

    Human->>UI: click
    UI->>Model: same method the dispatcher calls
    Note over Plane: POST /action (typed enum)
    Plane->>Model: identical method
    Model-->>Plane: state
    Plane->>Proof: state JSON + screenshot PNG
    Plane-->>Human: GET /state
    Note over Proof: receipts, not vibes (gate Q14)
